theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 18
text = "Welcome! 
You have been tasked to control a shield to protect Earth from a storm of meteors.
You can use your mouse or the arrow keys to protect Earth, whichever is most convient for you. 
As you get better and keep Earth alive longer, you will get an assistant, automatic ship that will aid you in your journey.
You will also gain the ability to shoot beams at UFOs to take them down by left clicking your mouse. 
You can pause at any time using the pause button at the top left, or by pressing the escape key.
See how long you can keep Earth intact and test your reflexes, but be warned, once the middle of the Earth is reached,
its game over.

Good Luck!
"

